WEBVTT

﻿1
00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.235
I can do this.

2
00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:11.322
I've got this.

3
00:01:12.156 --> 00:01:14.116
Here I come!

4
00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:22.166
Young-joo!

5
00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:43.020
I made it.

6
00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:47.066
I'm still alive!

7
00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.292
Sergeant Ahn.

8
00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.582
Hold on.

9
00:02:47.001 --> 00:02:48.210
Hey, stop!

10
00:02:48.711 --> 00:02:50.546
You're dead if we catch you!

11
00:02:54.967 --> 00:02:56.427
Where did she go?

12
00:03:00.639 --> 00:03:02.808
Where the hell is she?

13
00:03:06.145 --> 00:03:07.146
Damn, she's quick.

14
00:03:08.647 --> 00:03:10.899
You're the one that's fucking slow.

15
00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:11.859
Wait, over there.

16
00:03:12.359 --> 00:03:13.569
I just saw her.

17
00:03:14.111 --> 00:03:15.905
She's over there.

18
00:03:17.031 --> 00:03:20.617
Come on out.
We'll just chop your head off.

19
00:03:20.618 --> 00:03:22.827
I'm too tired for this, you fucking bitch!

20
00:03:22.828 --> 00:03:25.497
Do we have to come and find you?

21
00:03:28.417 --> 00:03:29.710
Just come out!

22
00:03:31.545 --> 00:03:32.504
Oh, man.

23
00:03:38.427 --> 00:03:39.844
Look, she's over there.

24
00:03:39.845 --> 00:03:41.805
- There she is.
- She's right there.

25
00:03:43.349 --> 00:03:45.309
I wonder where she is.

26
00:03:49.605 --> 00:03:51.272
I can't find her!

27
00:03:51.273 --> 00:03:54.068
I guess we're screwed.

28
00:03:55.194 --> 00:03:57.613
Where the fuck is she hiding?

29
00:03:58.322 --> 00:04:00.032
Fine, let's go home!

30
00:04:01.408 --> 00:04:03.369
Yeah, we should head back.

31
00:04:05.371 --> 00:04:09.166
- Hey, I said we're going home!
- We're leaving!

32
00:04:13.837 --> 00:04:15.171
There you are.

33
00:04:15.172 --> 00:04:17.340
Get over here, you fucking bitch!

34
00:04:17.341 --> 00:04:19.384
- Hey!
- Get her!

35
00:04:19.385 --> 00:04:21.135
- Don't let her get away!
- Hurry!

36
00:04:21.136 --> 00:04:22.762
Get over here, you bitch!

37
00:04:22.763 --> 00:04:25.808
You fucking bitch,
I'm going to skin you alive!

38
00:04:28.018 --> 00:04:29.228
You damn bitch!

39
00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:35.067
That damn weasel.

40
00:04:50.749 --> 00:04:52.292
Where are you?

41
00:04:54.253 --> 00:04:56.255
She's in the last car. Let's box her in.

42
00:05:06.974 --> 00:05:07.808
Get off me!

43
00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.351
Soo-jeong!

44
00:05:12.354 --> 00:05:13.897
Push them out the window!

45
00:05:20.571 --> 00:05:22.031
- Arron Park!
- Private.

46
00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:29.997
Send them this way!

47
00:05:30.289 --> 00:05:31.206
Private Lee.

48
00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.167
Over here!

49
00:05:34.168 --> 00:05:36.545
- That's Private Lee!
- Lee Jae-yoon!

50
00:05:37.921 --> 00:05:41.216
<i>Ra In-ho, Arron Park, I'm still alive!</i>

51
00:05:43.177 --> 00:05:44.386
Is everyone okay?

52
00:05:45.429 --> 00:05:48.389
Private Lee is alive and well down there!

53
00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.808
We need to focus!

54
00:06:00.903 --> 00:06:02.279
Shit.

55
00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.886
<i>I need all of you
to listen to me carefully.</i>

56
00:06:26.887 --> 00:06:30.682
Just think of it as a zip line.

57
00:06:32.101 --> 00:06:36.271
You're going to use your combat vests
to glide down the cable.

58
00:06:36.563 --> 00:06:37.396
Hold on tight.

59
00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:39.524
<i>The first thing you need to do</i>

60
00:06:39.525 --> 00:06:43.112
<i>is to bring over the swing stage cable
and secure it to the window frame.</i>

61
00:06:46.281 --> 00:06:47.783
<i>Once it is secured,</i>

62
00:06:48.826 --> 00:06:52.162
<i>I'll detach the cable from the swing stage</i>

63
00:06:53.622 --> 00:06:56.583
<i>and drag it over to the truck
across the intersection.</i>

64
00:06:57.376 --> 00:07:00.878
<i>Then, I'll secure the cable to the truck.</i>

65
00:07:00.879 --> 00:07:04.842
<i>This will create a zip line
from the eighth floor to the ground.</i>

66
00:07:05.634 --> 00:07:09.011
<i>I'll also use the mattresses
that are in the truck</i>

67
00:07:09.012 --> 00:07:12.099
<i>to create a safe landing spot.</i>

68
00:07:12.975 --> 00:07:17.896
<i>The mattresses will absorb the impact,
so you have nothing to worry about.</i>

69
00:07:19.148 --> 00:07:22.401
<i>As of now,
this seems to be the safest way down.</i>

70
00:07:25.779 --> 00:07:28.657
Come on down. Hurry!

71
00:07:29.366 --> 00:07:32.243
What if our combat vests rip and we fall?

72
00:07:32.244 --> 00:07:34.412
Our safety can't be guaranteed.

73
00:07:34.413 --> 00:07:35.663
Hey, jackass.

74
00:07:35.664 --> 00:07:39.083
If you want to deal with the zombies
outside that door, be my guest.

75
00:07:39.084 --> 00:07:40.419
Come on down!

76
00:07:42.713 --> 00:07:44.131
Fucking dumbass.

77
00:07:51.054 --> 00:07:52.055
You've got it!

78
00:07:52.806 --> 00:07:53.807
That's it!

79
00:07:55.267 --> 00:07:58.854
There you go. That was excellent!

80
00:07:59.396 --> 00:08:00.230
Good job.

81
00:08:02.941 --> 00:08:05.902
- That punk is something else.
- It's safe. Come on down!

82
00:08:05.903 --> 00:08:07.571
- Hey.
- Private Ra In-ho.

83
00:08:10.741 --> 00:08:11.909
You've got this, In-ho!

84
00:08:12.951 --> 00:08:15.036
- Ra In-ho!
- I don't think...

85
00:08:15.037 --> 00:08:17.788
- You can do this!
- I don't think I can do this.

86
00:08:17.789 --> 00:08:19.833
We don't have time for this.

87
00:08:23.629 --> 00:08:24.587
Come on, let's go!

88
00:08:24.588 --> 00:08:26.756
I just need a moment
to mentally prepare myself.

89
00:08:26.757 --> 00:08:27.883
Hold on tight.

90
00:08:29.051 --> 00:08:30.052
Oh, for god's sake.

91
00:08:31.678 --> 00:08:32.846
Look at him go.

92
00:08:38.018 --> 00:08:40.646
In-ho!

93
00:08:41.605 --> 00:08:43.941
There you go. That's it!

94
00:08:52.282 --> 00:08:55.451
I'm so happy to see you again, sir!

95
00:08:55.452 --> 00:08:58.663
It's such a relief
to see that you're all right!

96
00:08:58.664 --> 00:08:59.998
Thank goodness!

97
00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:03.961
What a fucking bromance.

98
00:09:04.336 --> 00:09:07.214
That little bitch is so damn fast.

99
00:09:08.674 --> 00:09:12.094
Hey, we're in the last car now!

100
00:09:13.136 --> 00:09:14.263
Open the door.

101
00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.056
Hell yeah, that's mine now.

102
00:09:21.186 --> 00:09:23.730
Open the damn door, you bastard.

103
00:09:25.065 --> 00:09:25.899
Shit.

104
00:09:35.909 --> 00:09:37.953
You motherfuckers, get away from me!

105
00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.248
Stay the fuck away! Back off!

106
00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:05.022
Hey, over here.

107
00:10:05.814 --> 00:10:08.984
Hurry, come this way.

108
00:10:22.122 --> 00:10:23.040
This way.

109
00:10:29.212 --> 00:10:30.713
- Next up!
- It's our turn now.

110
00:10:30.714 --> 00:10:32.173
- Yeah, let's go.
- Okay.

111
00:10:32.174 --> 00:10:33.883
- You're up, Soo-jeong.
- Okay.

112
00:10:33.884 --> 00:10:34.968
You've got this.

113
00:10:37.262 --> 00:10:39.764
- Mr. Park, are you okay?
- Hurry up!

114
00:10:39.765 --> 00:10:41.725
Corporal Kwak!

115
00:10:44.019 --> 00:10:45.311
- Go on.
- Okay.

116
00:10:45.312 --> 00:10:47.522
- I've got your back.
- All right.

117
00:10:51.443 --> 00:10:53.527
- Hold on.
- It's Soo-jeong.

118
00:10:53.528 --> 00:10:55.864
We don't have much time. Hurry!

119
00:10:56.740 --> 00:11:00.911
Don't worry, Soo-jeong.
I've got your back.

120
00:11:01.995 --> 00:11:04.538
I'm right behind you,
so just trust me and go.

121
00:11:04.539 --> 00:11:05.874
What the hell?

122
00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:09.585
Why are you acting all cheesy?

123
00:11:09.586 --> 00:11:12.589
Oh, I guess this isn't your thing.

124
00:11:12.881 --> 00:11:15.007
I'll try to cheese it down a bit.

125
00:11:15.008 --> 00:11:16.426
Seriously?

126
00:11:18.011 --> 00:11:20.138
Okay, fine. I appreciate it.

127
00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:22.307
Keep me safe.

128
00:11:23.392 --> 00:11:25.477
- Yes, ma'am!
- Oh, my god.

129
00:11:30.107 --> 00:11:30.941
Go!

130
00:11:34.319 --> 00:11:35.320
Please.

131
00:11:35.862 --> 00:11:38.698
You're doing great, Soo-jeong!

132
00:11:41.993 --> 00:11:42.828
Soo-jeong.

133
00:11:43.745 --> 00:11:45.287
- I did it.
- Are you okay?

134
00:11:45.288 --> 00:11:46.997
Well done!

135
00:11:46.998 --> 00:11:49.250
- That was great!
- Kwak Gye-young!

136
00:11:49.251 --> 00:11:51.086
She's a real badass.

137
00:11:52.087 --> 00:11:54.506
I'll be down in a sec, Soo-jeong!

138
00:12:01.179 --> 00:12:04.182
You can go first.
I'll be right behind you.

139
00:12:05.267 --> 00:12:06.393
Sure, I'll go first.

140
00:12:08.353 --> 00:12:09.187
Okay.

141
00:12:10.355 --> 00:12:12.774
- Wait, do you have a vest?
- See you down there.

142
00:12:18.405 --> 00:12:19.448
You're almost here.

143
00:12:25.162 --> 00:12:26.078
Kita hampir selesai.

144
00:12:26.079 --> 00:12:28.539
Sersan Kim, ayo turun.
Ini tidak seburuk kelihatannya!

145
00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:32.626
- Tunggu, rompi siapa ini?
- Itu milik Sersan Kim.

146
00:12:32.627 --> 00:12:33.545
Apa?

147
00:12:36.631 --> 00:12:37.841
- Lalu...
- Sersan Kim.

148
00:12:41.803 --> 00:12:44.472
Sersan Kim, bagaimana kabarmu?

149
00:12:44.473 --> 00:12:47.934
- Sersan Kim, cepatlah!
- Tunggu apa lagi?

150
00:12:50.896 --> 00:12:52.898
- Anda dapat ini, tuan!
- Tidak, berhenti.

151
00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.523
Tahan.

152
00:12:54.524 --> 00:12:56.526
Orang bodoh itu...

153
00:13:06.828 --> 00:13:08.205
Saya tidak punya banyak waktu lagi.

154
00:13:08.872 --> 00:13:10.874
- Apa?
- Apa yang dia bicarakan?

155
00:13:12.459 --> 00:13:13.460
menurutku...

156
00:13:15.629 --> 00:13:18.465
itu akan lebih baik bagiku
untuk tetap di sini.

157
00:13:25.597 --> 00:13:27.599
- Sersan Kim!
- Sersan...

158
00:13:28.475 --> 00:13:31.018
Sersan, turun ke sini dulu.

159
00:13:31.019 --> 00:13:32.436
Turun saja dan...

160
00:13:32.437 --> 00:13:34.605
- Kami membutuhkan alkohol.
- Oh benar.

161
00:13:34.606 --> 00:13:39.026
Anda akan baik-baik saja jika Anda minum alkohol.
Begitulah aku masih manusia.

162
00:13:39.027 --> 00:13:41.571
- Aku berjanji kita akan mencari tahu.
- Listen to him.

163
00:13:42.864 --> 00:13:45.699
<i>Alcohol? Come on now.</i>

164
00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.536
Wait, allow me.

165
00:13:48.119 --> 00:13:52.623
You saw how Arron Park didn't turn,
and I promise you won't, either.

166
00:13:52.624 --> 00:13:55.001
Please, just trust me on this.

167
00:13:56.628 --> 00:14:01.550
<i>In-ho, I absolutely believe you,</i>

168
00:14:02.801 --> 00:14:07.806
<i>but I think I'm too far along now.</i>

169
00:14:12.102 --> 00:14:15.397
<i>All of you better make it out alive.</i>

170
00:14:18.733 --> 00:14:23.405
<i>This will be my last order
as your sergeant.</i>

171
00:14:24.531 --> 00:14:28.201
No, wait, Sergeant Kim.

172
00:14:39.713 --> 00:14:40.922
Goddamnit.

173
00:14:47.637 --> 00:14:49.306
It's safe here.

174
00:14:52.309 --> 00:14:54.311
Be careful. Watch your step.

175
00:15:07.949 --> 00:15:08.825
This way.

176
00:15:14.247 --> 00:15:15.749
It's this way.

177
00:15:18.376 --> 00:15:19.336
We're almost there.

178
00:15:24.549 --> 00:15:27.718
Were they human when they died?

179
00:15:27.719 --> 00:15:31.139
They must have been,
considering the amount of blood.

180
00:15:32.015 --> 00:15:34.225
Those psychos from earlier
must have done it.

181
00:15:38.104 --> 00:15:39.731
I feel terrible for them.

182
00:15:45.028 --> 00:15:46.821
- Are you okay?
- What?

183
00:15:48.031 --> 00:15:49.157
I'm sorry.

184
00:15:54.496 --> 00:15:55.497
Come here.

185
00:16:00.669 --> 00:16:02.379
Don't worry. It's safe in here.

186
00:16:07.008 --> 00:16:11.554
We can take cover here for a bit
and go to Suseo Station together.

187
00:16:13.515 --> 00:16:16.350
- Any luck, In-ho?
- I'll continue searching, sir.

188
00:16:16.351 --> 00:16:19.437
- Oh, come on.
- I'm coming up with nothing.

189
00:16:36.454 --> 00:16:37.705
I found it!

190
00:16:37.706 --> 00:16:39.039
- You did?
- Really?

191
00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.042
- Nice work!
- Good job!

192
00:16:44.921 --> 00:16:46.131
I can take that.

193
00:16:47.465 --> 00:16:49.384
- Let's get going.
- Hold on.

194
00:16:49.968 --> 00:16:52.971
Where's Kyung-sik? He's not here.

195
00:16:54.848 --> 00:16:55.849
Well...

196
00:16:56.975 --> 00:17:00.186
He just took off
without saying anything earlier.

197
00:17:01.521 --> 00:17:03.148
Why are you telling me this now?

198
00:17:05.775 --> 00:17:07.026
Shit.

199
00:17:11.489 --> 00:17:14.492
We've already lost a lot of time,
so let's go to Suseo Station for now.

200
00:17:14.993 --> 00:17:16.119
All right, let's go.

201
00:18:29.567 --> 00:18:33.404
This kid got an award at boot camp.
He's top-tier.

202
00:18:34.364 --> 00:18:38.325
- His name is...
- Private Hwang Kyung-sik!

203
00:18:38.326 --> 00:18:41.912
You can't have a son who's also an ace.
That'd be too unfair.

204
00:18:41.913 --> 00:18:44.915
I have a feeling
I'm going to end up with a geezer son.

205
00:18:44.916 --> 00:18:47.918
You better knock on wood
before you jinx yourself, sir.

206
00:18:47.919 --> 00:18:51.463
- Kyung-sik, right?
- Private Hwang Kyung-sik!

207
00:18:51.464 --> 00:18:55.050
He's my son now.
You'd better not mess with him.

208
00:18:55.051 --> 00:18:57.678
Listen, son. I'll be your pops in here.

209
00:18:57.679 --> 00:19:00.807
Private Hwang Kyung-sik. Yes, sir!

210
00:19:08.356 --> 00:19:11.484
Private Hwang Kyung-sik. Thank you, sir!

211
00:19:12.193 --> 00:19:13.278
Eat up, son.

212
00:19:15.864 --> 00:19:19.284
There you go. You're all set.

213
00:19:19.909 --> 00:19:21.160
Private Hwang Kyung-sik.

214
00:19:21.786 --> 00:19:24.705
- Thank you, sir.
- You don't need to thank me.

215
00:19:24.706 --> 00:19:28.126
I wanted to polish your boots
before you went on your first leave.

216
00:19:28.793 --> 00:19:31.796
I'll iron your uniform later
so it has the sharpest creases.

217
00:19:33.047 --> 00:19:34.340
Oh, one more thing.

218
00:19:34.841 --> 00:19:37.801
- Here you go.
- That's all right, sir.

219
00:19:37.802 --> 00:19:41.138
Go on and take it.
Your birthday is coming up.

220
00:19:41.139 --> 00:19:44.433
- So get yourself a snack.
- I'm okay, sir.

221
00:19:44.434 --> 00:19:47.311
- Come on, just take it already.
- No, sir...

222
00:19:47.312 --> 00:19:48.563
You punk.

223
00:19:54.319 --> 00:19:55.153
Thank you.

224
00:19:58.865 --> 00:19:59.782
Pops.

225
00:21:08.893 --> 00:21:09.727
Brengsek.

226
00:21:35.545 --> 00:21:37.629
Silakan ambil.

227
00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:40.590
<i>- Halo? Young-joo?</i>
- Bu!

228
00:21:40.591 --> 00:21:43.510
<i>- Young-joo!</i>
- Apakah kamu baik-baik saja?

229
00:21:43.511 --> 00:21:45.138
Kamu aman, kan?

230
00:21:47.098 --> 00:21:51.601
<i>Apakah kamu baik-baik saja? Apakah kamu aman?
Dimana kamu sekarang?</i>

231
00:21:51.602 --> 00:21:54.938
Saya di Stasiun Terminal Bus Ekspres.

232
00:21:54.939 --> 00:21:57.984
<i>Young-joo, apakah aman di sana?</i>

233
00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:00.360
<i>Kamu aman, kan?</i>

234
00:22:00.361 --> 00:22:04.489
Ya, aku baik-baik saja,
jadi jangan khawatirkan aku.

235
00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:08.453
<i>- Kenapa kamu tidak menemui Jae-yoon?</i>
- Ceritanya panjang.

236
00:22:09.037 --> 00:22:12.498
Tapi petugas stasiun membantu saya,
dan aku aman sekarang.

237
00:22:13.041 --> 00:22:15.293
Jadi, tetaplah di rumah saja
dan jangan kemana-mana, oke?

238
00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:18.129
<i>Kenapa kamu pergi ke sana?</i>

239
00:22:18.713 --> 00:22:21.506
Saya pergi menemui Jae-yoon,

240
00:22:21.507 --> 00:22:23.968
tapi ada beberapa hal yang terjadi,
jadi aku berakhir di sini.

241
00:22:24.802 --> 00:22:26.971
<i>Bagaimana caramu pulang?</i>

242
00:22:27.597 --> 00:22:29.306
Saat ini di luar terlalu gelap.

243
00:22:29.307 --> 00:22:32.601
Saya akan pergi ke Stasiun Suseo besok pagi
lalu langsung pulang.

244
00:22:32.602 --> 00:22:33.686
<i>Di mana?</i>

245
00:22:34.604 --> 00:22:35.605
<i>Young-joo?</i>

246
00:22:36.522 --> 00:22:37.523
<i>Young-joo?</i>

247
00:22:38.775 --> 00:22:40.525
<i>Apakah semuanya baik-baik saja, Young--</i>

248
